{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05这类短停留段落里感受词仍然偏密，交替排布也更容易让人来不及扫完；X的双栏短词更利于快速掠读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用高亮把每段叙事的关键动机和转折钉住，感受词又能按照音乐进程出现，因此更容易抓住人物为何靠近、退缩、重新放松，最后选择不再隐藏。水面、船、波浪、声线等意象也形成了更连贯的整体，音乐细节与心理变化结合得更细腻。它的主要代价是部分段落信息过密，X反而更容易快速扫读，但综合理解、情绪递进和音乐感受，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5faa175-0179-409f-b406-10d7b71d39a8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005624443643Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:57:39.042963+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "acb5bad21428f5d02445965d48293729b3c4f5b0767311e9644daa2e7f9aa71b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed